Keep a shared stepx as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into stepx.
Place 1 into stepx.
Place 0 into stepx.
Place -1 into stepx.
Keep a shared stepy as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into stepy.
Place 0 into stepy.
Place -1 into stepy.
Place 0 into stepy.
Keep a shared barrierx as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared barriery as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared east as 0.
Keep a shared north as 0.
Keep a shared dir as 0.
Keep a shared best as 0.
Keep a shared probex as 0.
Keep a shared probey as 0.
Keep a shared blocked as 0.
To obstruct from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of barrierx, return.
If item spot of barrierx is probex and item spot of barriery is probey, set blocked to 1, return.
Obstruct from spot plus 1.

To advance from remaining (a whole number).
If remaining is 0, return.
The way is dir.
The nextx is east plus item way of stepx.
The nexty is north plus item way of stepy.
Set probex to nextx.
Set probey to nexty.
Set blocked to 0.
Obstruct from 0.
If blocked is 1, return.
Set east to nextx.
Set north to nexty.
The reach is east times east plus north times north.
If reach is more than best, set best to reach.
Advance from remaining minus 1.

The commands is a list of 4, -1, and 3.
For each command in commands.
If command is equal to -1, set dir to dir plus 1 modulo 4.
If command is equal to -2, set dir to dir plus 3 modulo 4.
If command is more than 0, Advance from command.

Show best.
